    "text": "By WDRB Digital Staff ,\n5 hours ago LOUISVILLE, Ky. (WDRB) — A woman arrested for a fire at a Louisville apartment complex over the weekend reportedly said she was \"going to kill everybody.\" According to an arrest citation, 68-year-old Elizabeth Radmacher was charged with arson, wanton endangerment and criminal mischief for intentionally setting her apartment on fire. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
